    {
      "id": "e5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 78,
      "y": 161,
      "width": 379.875,
      "height": 371.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#b66a19",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1.25,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1913939881,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1907457545,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793607758433,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "原子累加\n\n初始化 out = 0\n↓\n各 block 求自己的部分和\n↓\n每 block 只做一次 atomicAdd\n↓\n该 kernel 完成后结果可用\n\n同地址更新有争用；浮点顺序可变",
      "fontSize": 25,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "原子累加\n\n初始化 out = 0\n↓\n各 block 求自己的部分和\n↓\n每 block 只做一次 atomicAdd\n↓\n该 kernel 完成后结果可用\n\n同地址更新有争用；浮点顺序可变",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 610,
      "y": 145,
