    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 628,
      "y": 161,
      "width": 405.20001220703125,
      "height": 371.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#227f68",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1.25,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1348176521,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1556534505,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793607758433,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "分层归约\n\n预分配 partial\n↓\n各 block 写不同 partial 元素\n↓\n下一 kernel 汇合，必要时多层\n↓\n最后一层输出标量\n\n多一次启动与流量；无单点原子争用",
      "fontSize": 25,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "分层归约\n\n预分配 partial\n↓\n各 block 写不同 partial 元素\n↓\n下一 kernel 汇合，必要时多层\n↓\n最后一层输出标量\n\n多一次启动与流量；无单点原子争用",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "e8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 655,
      "width": 850.920166015625,
      "height": 32.400000000000006,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#bf4242",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1.25,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 484376199,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1466698279,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793607758433,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "每次原子运行都要重新初始化；只在第一次清零会让重复计时不断累加旧结果。",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "每次原子运行都要重新初始化；只在第一次清零会让重复计时不断累加旧结果。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "e9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 852.7020263671875,
      "height": 31.05,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#243247",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1.25,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
